<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Humana upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Humana upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer &amp; Co said on Wendesday it upgraded its rating on shares of Humana Inc to a buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Humana shares were unchanged at 24-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
